==== OEM easy installation ====

1. Remove all dots from the factory image filename (except the dot before file extension).

2. Upload and update the firmware via the original web interface.

3. Wait until green status led stops blinking (can take several minutes).

4. Login to OpenWrt initramsfs. It's recommended to make a backup of the mtd partitions at this point.

4. Perform sysupgrade using the following command (or use Luci): <code>sysupgrade -n sysupgrade.bin</code>

5. Wait until green status led stops blinking (can take several minutes).

6. Mission accomplished.

